                                "sense_id": "b97ffa77-276e-33dd-84eb-c2c68126b011",
                                "text": "She understands my moviegoing but in her own antic fashion. There is a scene which shows the very neighborhood of the theater. Kate gives me a look—it is understood that we do not speak during the movie."
                            },
