                                "example_id": "490d4cc0-cdff-4af5-9f2d-1ae8d1dcfb90",
                                "sense_id": "b97ffa77-276e-33dd-84eb-c2c68126b011",
                                "text": "I would say that roughly 30 percent of the film is invisible, and some 40 to 50 inaudible. I cannot remember when—in moviegoing or life—I so longed for an honest bit of daylight as I did while groping my way through Bird."
